    "long_instructions": "TODOs:\r\n*   Find a short piece of text online or from your school materials (e.g., a paragraph from a news article or a textbook). Copy and paste it into the chat.\r\n*   Ask the AI to summarize this text for you. Just a simple summary.\r\n*   Next, ask the AI to summarize the *same* text again, but this time specify that you want a \"TL;DR\" (Too Long; Didn't Read) version.\r\n*   Then, ask the AI to summarize the text once more, but instruct it to write a \"formal summary\" suitable for a school report.\r\n*   Compare the different summaries: How did the AI adapt the text based on your instructions? Which summary is most useful for what purpose?\r\n*   Finally, try asking the AI to summarize the text for a very specific audience, like a younger child, a busy parent, or even an alien!",
